{'symbol': 'COO', 'date': '2020-11-12 16:15:00', 'title': 'COOPERCOMPANIES ELECTS TERESA S. MADDEN TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF., NOV. 12, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COOPERCOMPANIES (NYSE: COO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTED TERESA S. MADDEN TO THE BOARD AS AN INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 2020.'}